if {CaptainTalked} == 1:
	captain: "You're alright, kid!"
	[end_timeline]
captain: "Barhand! We're celebrating a strong victory over some thieving goblins!"
- (A win well earned, I'm sure.)
	{PlayerName}: "A win well earned, I'm sure. Congratulations to you and your band."
	captain: "Aye, it was a hell of a fight!"
- (Read Thoughts)
	captain: [i]This beer is fantastic! I shouldn't have any more, but it's so good...[/i]
	{PlayerName}: "You know, another round for your band would really seal the deal."
	captain: "The kid's right! Another round for all you shaggy dogs!"
	[signal arg="crowns_5"]
set {CaptainTalked} = 1
set {PatronsTalked} += 1
[end_timeline]
